The implementation is now executable Python and translates cleanly. I chose a structurally recursive formulation: it handles empty substrings explicitly, checks the current prefix with the supplied `startswith` semantics, and advances exactly one character, which mirrors an inductive overlapping-occurrence definition and gives the prover a natural recursion measure.
